[gd_resource type="StandardMaterial3D" load_steps=4 format=3]

; Repointed from a 1K damaged-road set tinted warm grey (0.66, 0.64, 0.60), which
; under the late-afternoon sun read as brown mud rather than asphalt, to the Poly
; Haven 2K cracked-asphalt scan. The albedo tint is now neutral and slightly cool
; so the surface keeps reading as bitumen in warm light, and the full ARM set is
; wired so the road finally has roughness variation instead of behaving like flat
; paint. World triplanar keeps texel density constant across the 220 m road box.
